&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: center"&gt;貸借対照表計上額の&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: center"&gt;合計額（百万円）&lt;/p&gt;
